  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Genymobile/scrcpy/tarball/v5.0.1",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Genymobile/scrcpy/zipball/v5.0.1",
  "body": "_To receive a notification when a new release is available, click on **Watch > Custom > Releases** at the top._\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**scrcpy v5.0.1**\r\n\r\nChanges since v5.0:\r\n - Accept DRM_FORMAT_RG88 for NV12 chroma plane (#7070, #7073)\r\n - Fix H.265 hardware decoding on Windows (#7072)\r\n - Use the GPU of the renderer for VA-API decoding (#7075, #7081)\r\n - Force EGL only if VA-API is enabled (#7079)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<a id=\"highlights-v5.0.1\"></a>\r\n\r\n# Highlights\r\n\r\n## Hardware decoding fixes\r\n\r\n[Scrcpy 5.0](https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/releases/tag/v5.0) introduced hardware decoding.\r\n\r\nThis patch release (5.0.1) fixes several issues:\r\n - on Linux with an NVIDIA VA-API driver (#7070, #7073)\r\n - for H.265 on Windows depending on the driver (#7072)\r\n - with multiple GPUs on Linux, when decoding used a different GPU than rendering (#7075, #7081)\r\n - with the OpenGL renderer on Windows and macOS (#7079)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n - BlueSky: [`@scrcpy.bsky.social`](https://bsky.app/profile/scrcpy.bsky.social)\r\n - Twitter: [`@scrcpy_app`](https://twitter.com/scrcpy_app)\r\n - Reddit: [`r/scrcpy`](https://www.reddit.com/r/scrcpy)",
